  "main_text": "Why the Garvee Affiliate Program?\nEarn Commissions\nIf you promote our brand products and get some qualifying orders, you will earn commissions.\nCompetitive Commissions Rate\n45-days guarantee\nUp to 30-day cookie period\nAverage order value of $250\nTrusted Brand\nGARVEE, one-stop home improvement solutions brand in US, is providing high-quality products for all customers.\nFree shipping & return\nLast Click Attribution Tracking\nHuge selection of products\n24/7 customer service\nEasy to Manage\nGarvee affiliate program is free & easy to join. We provide various assets and your account manager is always ready to help.\nFrequent banners & text links\nClear performance report\nReliable third-party tracking\nDedicated manager support\nEarn Commissions\nIf you promote our brand products and get some qualifying orders, you will earn commissions.\nCompetitive Commissions Rate\n45-days guarantee\nUp to 30-day cookie period\nAverage order value of $250\nTrusted Brand\nGARVEE, one-stop home improvement solutions brand in US, is providing high-quality products for all customers.\nFree shipping & return\nLast Click Attribution Tracking\nHuge selection of products\n24/7 customer service\nEasy to Manage\nGarvee affiliate program is free & easy to join. We provide various assets and your account manager is always ready to help.\nFrequent banners & text links\nClear performance report\nReliable third-party tracking\nDedicated manager support\nStart Earning in 3 Simple Steps\nChoose Your Platform\nJoin our Direct Program or connect via your preferred Affiliate Network.\nGARVEE Direct Program\nPowered by UpPromote. The fastest way to generate your links, access exclusive creatives, and get paid directly by us.\nInstant Setup\nExclusive Coupons\nJoin Direct Program\nAWIN\nBest for European and Global publishers seeking robust tracking.\nJoin via AWIN\nimpact\nIdeal for creators and influencers seeking seamless integration.\nJoin via Impact\nCJ Affiliate\nPerfect for top-tier loyalty, coupon, and traditional marketers.\nJoin via CJ\nFREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS\nQ：Who can join the Garvee affiliate program?\nWe welcome all website operators who operate friendly websites (Do not involve pornography, gambling and drugs) and mainly have a US audience to join. But they must abide by the terms and conditions of the program.\nQ：Are there any fees or costs for becoming a member of Garvee Affiliate?\nQ：How often are commissions paid?\nQ：Will Garvee provide promotion banners or text links?\nQ：How many products, banners, text links and other creatives can I place on my site?\nQ：Can I use Garvee graphics and content from the target website?"
